<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logo.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Global Header Navigation Partial -->
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <main>
    <!-- Page Header Banner Partial -->
    <%- include('partials/header', { 
      title: 'Frequently Asked Questions', 
      subtitle: 'Find answers regarding our digital marketing services, campaign ROI, payment options, and career opportunities.' 
    }) %>

    <!-- FAQS ACCORDION SECTION -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">

        <!-- GROUP 1: WORKING WITH US (PRIMARY SECTION) -->
        <div class="faq-group faq-group-primary">
          <div class="faq-group-header">
            <h2 class="faq-group-title">Working With Us</h2>
            <p class="faq-group-subtitle">Everything you need to know about our marketing campaigns, strategy, billing, and client policies.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-accordion-container">
            
            <!-- Q1 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item" open>
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How long does it take to see results from your marketing campaigns?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Results vary based on industry, competition, and campaign complexity. Typically, you can expect to see initial results within 2-3 months, with significant improvements in 6-12 months.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q2 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How do you measure the success of a marketing campaign?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>We use key performance indicators (KPIs) tailored to your business goals. These include metrics like website traffic, lead generation, conversion rates, and return on investment (ROI).</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q3 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">What kind of budget is required for digital marketing?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Budgets vary widely depending on your goals and industry. We offer tailored packages to fit different needs, and we prioritize ROI to maximize your investment.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q4 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How do you stay up-to-date with the latest digital marketing trends?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Our team is dedicated to continuous learning and industry research. We attend conferences, webinars, and workshops to stay ahead of the curve and implement the most effective strategies for our clients.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q5 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How do I know if your agency is the right fit for my business?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>We offer free consultations to discuss your goals and challenges. This allows us to assess your needs and recommend the best solutions. We believe in building long-term partnerships based on trust and results.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q6 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">What payment methods do you accept?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>We accept credit cards, bank transfers, Payoneer, and other secure online payment methods.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q7 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">Do you offer flexible payment plans?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Yes, we offer flexible payment plans to accommodate your budget and project needs.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q8 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">Is there an initial deposit required?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Yes, a 50% deposit is required to start the project, with the remaining balance due upon completion.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q9 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">Can I pay on a monthly basis?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Absolutely, we offer monthly billing options for ongoing services and retainers.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q10 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">What is your refund policy?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Refunds are evaluated on a case-by-case basis, typically within 30 days if services have not been rendered.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q11 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How will I receive invoices?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Invoices are emailed directly to you and are also accessible through your client portal.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- GROUP 2: CAREERS & INTERNSHIPS (SECONDARY SECTION) -->
        <div class="faq-group faq-group-secondary">
          <div class="faq-group-header">
            <h2 class="faq-group-title">Careers & Internships</h2>
            <p class="faq-group-subtitle">Information on applying to open positions and transitioning into full-time roles.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-accordion-container">
            
            <!-- Q1 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">How do I apply for one of your open positions?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Browse our current openings on the <a href="/jobs" class="text-link">Jobs & Internships page</a> and submit your details through our <a href="/contact" class="text-link">Contact form</a>, mentioning the position you're interested in.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <!-- Q2 -->
            <details class="faq-accordion-item">
              <summary class="faq-accordion-summary">Can an internship lead to a full-time role?</summary>
              <div class="faq-accordion-body">
                <p>Yes — strong performance during an internship is regularly considered for a permanent position as our team grows.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CLOSING CTA SECTION -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-container">
          <h2 class="cta-title">Still Have Questions?</h2>
          <p class="cta-text">
            Reach out to our strategy and account team directly for personalized guidance regarding services, custom pricing, or career opportunities.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Our Team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Global Footer Partial -->
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
